        <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><input type="color" id="p-lights-color" value="#ffffff">
          <input type="range" id="p-lights-bri" min="1" max="100" step="1" style="flex:1"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hint">These controls act at once, like the overlay of the panel and the Home Assistant entities. The times and the update settings are saved in the settings of the panel.</div>
      <div id="panel-status" class="status"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="stale" class="card">
    <p id="stale-text">The settings of the panel changed after this page loaded. Reload the page before you save.</p>
